WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.692
The phrase candidate clean row is intentional
Passing selected checks

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:11.349
does not mean every fact is verified It means the
row satisfies the

00:00:11.375 --> 00:00:17.287
rules we implemented for this exercise Review rows
still need attention

00:00:19.031 --> 00:00:24.723
Duplicate ranking still requires policy or evidence
Use labels

00:00:24.749 --> 00:00:27.315
that accurately describe what your process knows
